#
# 11g's reply to `update ... returning s into :2` into a 2-byte target (#2466):
# 'ab', the indicator 6 (the whole length) and the return code 1406, then the
# NULL; then the status.
# Captured 2026-11-06 through tools/capture_proxy.py: an OCI 11.2 program
# (instant client 11.2, x86-64 Linux, the client charset AL32UTF8; an array
# OCIStmtExecute, the RETURNING targets bound OCI_DATA_AT_EXEC with
# OCIBindDynamic, called through ctypes) on Oracle 11g XE 11.2.0.2 with
# SERVER=POOLED, the DRCP pool started, on pyo_drcp_ar (id NUMBER, g NUMBER,
# s VARCHAR2(10)) holding (100, 1, 'abcdef'), (101, 1, NULL), (200, 2, 'x').
# The TTC payload, without the packet's header, as `hexdump -C` output; the
# offset column and the |ascii| gutter are ignored by tests.replay.parse_hexdump.
00000000  0b 01 05 4c 02 00 00 00  00 00 01 00 00 00 00 00  |...L............|
00000010  00 00 00 00 00 00 ff 7f  00 00 00 00 dd 8f 00 00  |................|
00000020  00 00 68 4c 46 33 ee 7f  00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00  |..hLF3..........|
00000030  00 00 20 10 07 02 00 00  00 02 61 62 06 00 7e 05  |.. .......ab..~.|
00000040  00 ff ff 7d 05 08 06 00  92 f3 79 00 00 00 00 00  |...}......y.....|
00000050  04 00 00 00 01 00 00 00  00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00  |................|
00000060  00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00  04 02 00 00 00 14 00 01  |................|
00000070  02 00 00 00 00 00 00 00  00 00 04 00 07 00 06 00  |................|
00000080  00 00 00 03 26 13 02 00  04 00 00 00 05 1a 00 00  |....&...........|
00000090  01 00 00 00 00 00 00 00  00 14 00 00 01 00 00 00  |................|
000000a0  00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00  00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00  |................|
000000b0  20 f6 31 0a 00 00 00 00  0d 00 00 00 00 00 00 00  | .1.............|
000000c0  00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00  00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00  |................|
000000d0  00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00  00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00  |................|
000000e0  00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00  00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00  |................|
000000f0  0d 00 0d 01 00 02 13 26  00 04 00 00 1a 05 00 01  |.......&........|
00000100
